      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sub-Office fully established, with well-functioning Operational Office space achieved fully and equipped with office furniture, ICT Equipment, Security, Office Vehicles, Safe Room, Conference Room with State of the Art conference/meetings equipment, etc.

Large portion of the planned National staff was hired onboarded using Approved Fast Trac measures. Key PIP international staff positions were hired and onboarded, and just a few were reserved for more funding after mobilizing Donor Resources.

Cost-sharing of office Premises with sister Agency UNFPA was fully achieved with MOU in place, withing progress reporting on agreed cost-share needs met.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
